<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8749" root="حل" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِلَّةٌ</span></b>  <i>A mode,</i> or <i>manner, of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُلُول</span> [i. e. <i>alighting, taking up one's abode, lodging,</i> or <i>settling</i>].
(K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَالٌّ</span>, in three places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And
see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحَلٌّ</span>, in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  Also (tropical:)  <i>A collection
of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُيُوت</span> [i. e. <i>tents,</i> or <i>houses,</i>] (Msb, K) <i>of
men;</i> (K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحَلَّةٌ</span></b> : (Har p. 333:) or
(K) <i>a hundred thereof,</i> (Msb, K,) and <i>more:</i>
pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِلَالٌ</span>. (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  (assumed tropical:)  <i>A sitting-place,</i> or the
<i>people thereof;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَجْلِسٌ</span>: [or] (assumed tropical:)  <i>a place of
assembly:</i> pl. as above. (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَلَّةٌ</span>,
in two places.

